§ `Article 3(1): is it an AI system?`

-- Under Article 3(1), as a deployer of an AI system, is the software I use an AI system
-- all four elements met: TRUE ("a machine-based system that is designed to operate with varying levels of autonomy ... and that ... infers, from the input it receives, how to generate outputs ... that can influence physical or virtual environments")
-- MIRROR Art 3(1): the same software asked from the provider, deployer and person seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(1), as a deployer of an AI system, is the software I use an AI system` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- not machine-based: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(1), as a deployer of an AI system, is the software I use an AI system` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- no autonomy: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(1), as a deployer of an AI system, is the software I use an AI system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- does not infer how to generate outputs: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(1), as a deployer of an AI system, is the software I use an AI system` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- outputs cannot influence physical or virtual environments: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(1), as a deployer of an AI system, is the software I use an AI system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 3(3) to (8): does the definition of my role fit me?`

-- Under Article 3(4), as a deployer of an AI system, does the definition of a deployer fit me
-- uses the system under its authority, in a professional activity: TRUE ("using an AI system under its authority")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(4), as a deployer of an AI system, does the definition of a deployer fit me` TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- uses it under its authority for a personal non-professional activity: FALSE ("except where the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(4), as a deployer of an AI system, does the definition of a deployer fit me` TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- does not use the system under its authority: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(4), as a deployer of an AI system, does the definition of a deployer fit me` FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- does not use it under its authority and the use is personal: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(4), as a deployer of an AI system, does the definition of a deployer fit me` FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE

-- Under Article 3(8), as a deployer of an AI system, am I an operator
-- the seat's role is passed as the keel's `Role`: TRUE ("'operator' means a provider, product manufacturer, deployer, authorised representative, importer or distributor"): the role of this seat is on the list
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(8), as a deployer of an AI system, am I an operator` EQUALS TRUE


