-- 1 August 2027, the day before the placement bound: placed before 2 August 2027, so JUST 31 December 2030 ("placed on the market or put into service before 2 August 2027")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a deployer of an AI system, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1861" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
