#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a deployer of an AI system, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" EQUALS NOTHING
-- Annex X point 1(c), Regulation (EU) 2018/1862: JUST 31 December 2030
