-- 26 July 2026, the text as enacted: JUST 31 December 2030 (paragraph 1 was not changed by the Omnibus)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a deployer of an AI system, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST 31 December 2030
