-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions of seat deployer from part P1 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P1-cases-seat-deployer: cases for the seat layer of a deployer of an AI system: the facts a real deployer would state, one question after another.
-- Every question has at least one case; a case outside the encoding asserts the explicit NOTHING (not covered) where the question has one. The expected answers are written from the text,
-- one fact at a time, as in the layer-1 tests (P1-tests-*.l4). A case marked MIRROR asks the same facts as the partner seat's case file and the answers agree.

§ `Under Article 5: who is asking`

-- Under Article 5, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)?
-- uses an AI system under its authority, professionally
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` TRUE FALSE
-- personal non-professional activity
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Article 5, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` TRUE TRUE)
-- does not use an AI system
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Article 5, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` FALSE FALSE)

