§ `Under Annex II: the offences for the use exception`

-- Under Annex II point 1 to 16, as a deployer of an AI system, is the offence for which I use the system one of the criminal offences listed in Annex II?
-- terrorism is listed
#ASSERT `Under Annex II point 1 to 16, as a deployer of an AI system, is the offence for which I use the system one of the criminal offences listed in Annex II` `Annex II 1 terrorism` FALSE
-- participation in a criminal organisation involved in none of the listed offences
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Annex II point 1 to 16, as a deployer of an AI system, is the offence for which I use the system one of the criminal offences listed in Annex II` `Annex II 16 participation in a criminal organisation involved in one or more of the offences listed above` FALSE)
-- involved in a listed offence
#ASSERT `Under Annex II point 1 to 16, as a deployer of an AI system, is the offence for which I use the system one of the criminal offences listed in Annex II` `Annex II 16 participation in a criminal organisation involved in one or more of the offences listed above` TRUE
-- no listed offence
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Annex II point 1 to 16, as a deployer of an AI system, is the offence for which I use the system one of the criminal offences listed in Annex II` `Annex II no listed offence` FALSE)

