§ `The role and the applicability of the provisions`

-- uses an AI system under its authority in a professional activity
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- uses it in the course of a personal non-professional activity
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- does not use an AI system under its authority
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a deployer of an AI system, am I a deployer within the meaning of Article 3(4)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a): 2 February 2025)
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day Chapter I begins to apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the first day of the text as amended
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): they do not apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 1 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day they begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an Annex I system on 2 December 2027: its date is 2 August 2028 (Art 113(c)(ii))
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before they apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2028) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day they begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2028) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- placed earlier and not significantly changed: saved by Article 111(2)
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- placed earlier and significantly changed since: covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a system that is not high-risk: no date of application, they do not apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a deployer of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route neither` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Under Article 4a: processing special categories of personal data for bias detection and correction`

-- special categories, every element met, by a party the paragraph names
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a deployer of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a deployer of an AI system that is not high-risk: the paragraph names it too
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a deployer of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not special categories of personal data
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a deployer of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not met: appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a deployer of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a deployer of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a deployer of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a deployer of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations
